  "mechanism": "A distributed coordination primitive where a value (clock, version, balance) never decreases. This simplifies consensus: a node seeing a higher value knows it is seeing later state, without needing to compare histories. It is the foundation of logical clocks and CRDTs, and relies on a {{state_lock}} (or CRDT logic) to ensure the value never regresses.",
